WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.050
STEPHANIE WONG: All right, look.

00:00:01.050 --> 00:00:03.480
Finding your favorite products
and discovering new ones

00:00:03.480 --> 00:00:06.270
requires a user interface
that's easy to use,

00:00:06.270 --> 00:00:08.430
informative, clear,
and delightful.

00:00:08.430 --> 00:00:11.550
Google Cloud users have mainly
used our side menu to navigate.

00:00:11.550 --> 00:00:14.040
But with almost 100
products and growing,

00:00:14.040 --> 00:00:16.890
it's safe to say our product
list has outgrown the side

00:00:16.890 --> 00:00:17.730
menu.

00:00:17.730 --> 00:00:19.958
Over time, we have
listened to your feedback.

00:00:19.958 --> 00:00:21.750
And some of you have
highlighted challenges

00:00:21.750 --> 00:00:24.520
navigating the Console
to explore our products.

00:00:24.520 --> 00:00:26.490
We've heard over and
over again that it's

00:00:26.490 --> 00:00:28.355
difficult and
time-consuming to scroll

00:00:28.355 --> 00:00:29.730
through the long
list of products

00:00:29.730 --> 00:00:31.710
and remember what
each one offers.

00:00:31.710 --> 00:00:34.530
So that's why we created
a new All Products

00:00:34.530 --> 00:00:37.620
page to help you easily navigate
to your favorite Google Cloud

00:00:37.620 --> 00:00:38.340
products.

00:00:38.340 --> 00:00:41.370
This page showcases all of
the Google Cloud products,

00:00:41.370 --> 00:00:43.290
as well as our key
partner products,

00:00:43.290 --> 00:00:45.480
in one easy to navigate place.

00:00:45.480 --> 00:00:47.760
With one click, you can
discover the right product

00:00:47.760 --> 00:00:49.890
that's right for your solution.

00:00:49.890 --> 00:00:52.210
The page is organized
into different categories,

00:00:52.210 --> 00:00:57.120
including management, compute,
storage, operations, security,

00:00:57.120 --> 00:01:00.900
CI/CD, artificial intelligence,
support, and more.

00:01:00.900 --> 00:01:02.820
Quickly jump to the
category of interest

00:01:02.820 --> 00:01:06.180
through the panel on the left or
you can scroll the entire page.

00:01:06.180 --> 00:01:07.920
Then you can click
each product name

00:01:07.920 --> 00:01:10.590
to navigate directly to
the product home page.

00:01:10.590 --> 00:01:13.110
Each product listing also
includes a short and long

00:01:13.110 --> 00:01:16.200
description so you can quickly
understand what a product does

00:01:16.200 --> 00:01:18.300
and whether it fits your needs.

00:01:18.300 --> 00:01:20.550
This lets you compare
categories at a glance,

00:01:20.550 --> 00:01:24.540
saving you the hassle of digging
up product overviews elsewhere.

00:01:24.540 --> 00:01:26.820
Under each product,
you'll also find a link

00:01:26.820 --> 00:01:29.070
to documentation
and quick starts

00:01:29.070 --> 00:01:31.140
so you can understand
it in more depth

00:01:31.140 --> 00:01:33.360
and try it out
right away, removing

00:01:33.360 --> 00:01:37.500
the extra step of navigating to
documentation in another tab.

00:01:37.500 --> 00:01:41.010
To make navigation even easier,
you can pin products directly

00:01:41.010 --> 00:01:43.590
from the All Products
page, and they'll show up

00:01:43.590 --> 00:01:45.520
at the top of your side menu.

00:01:45.520 --> 00:01:47.430
You can also customize
your navigation

00:01:47.430 --> 00:01:50.040
by reordering pins
in the side menu.

00:01:50.040 --> 00:01:52.860
That way, you can quickly
access your most used products

00:01:52.860 --> 00:01:54.750
directly from the
side menu, instead

00:01:54.750 --> 00:01:57.990
of scrolling through the panel
or the All Products page.

00:01:57.990 --> 00:02:01.290
With the new All Products page,
you can save time scrolling

00:02:01.290 --> 00:02:03.090
and cut straight
to the good stuff--

00:02:03.090 --> 00:02:05.160
finding your products,
discovering new ones,

00:02:05.160 --> 00:02:07.240
learning, and getting hands-on.

00:02:07.240 --> 00:02:09.780
So try it out for yourself by
heading to the Google Cloud

00:02:09.780 --> 00:02:10.500
Console.

00:02:10.500 --> 00:02:13.500
Click the side panel and
click View All Products.

00:02:13.500 --> 00:02:15.990
Or on the home dashboard,
you'll see a call-out

00:02:15.990 --> 00:02:18.280
to try out the
All Products page.

00:02:18.280 --> 00:02:20.820
If you have any feedback
about this new experience,

00:02:20.820 --> 00:02:22.380
I actually want to hear.

00:02:22.380 --> 00:02:25.950
So reach out to me on
Twitter stephr_wong

00:02:25.950 --> 00:02:28.020
or on LinkedIn @stephrwong.

00:02:28.020 --> 00:02:29.840
See you there.

